    source:{ name:"Anthropic", handle:"Anthropic", platform:"web", kind:"lab" },
    text:"Anthropic's status page flagged degraded performance across claude.ai, the Claude API, Claude Code and Claude Cowork starting 13:50 UTC on August 12, with elevated errors on Claude Opus 5, Fable 5 and Sonnet 5. Anthropic marked the incident resolved by 18:07 UTC the same day. The company has previously attributed similar incidents to demand outpacing available compute capacity.",
