    text:"Anthropic told investors it expects $10.9 billion in Q2 2026 revenue -- up from $4.8 billion in Q1 -- with a projected $559 million first-ever quarterly operating profit, as compute costs fell from 71 cents to 56 cents per revenue dollar. These are unaudited figures shared with investors during an active fundraising process, not confirmed public results; Anthropic is not yet subject to public-company reporting requirements.",
