    source:{ name:"Microsoft", handle:"Microsoft", platform:"web", kind:"lab" },
    text:"Microsoft is merging its standalone consumer Copilot app into Microsoft 365 Copilot, retiring Group Chats, AI-generated podcasts, Copilot Labs experimental features, and its Mico mascot by August 18; consumer Deep Research is replaced by a 'Researcher' feature. Files migrate to OneDrive. Microsoft frames it as acknowledging that personal and professional AI use overlap too much to justify two separate apps competing against ChatGPT, Claude, and Gemini with a fragmented product line.",
    why:"A major vendor conceding its two-app Copilot strategy didn't work and consolidating rather than iterating on both — a real data point on how the biggest non-lab AI distributor is repositioning against the standalone chat assistants.",
