    text:"Google launched Gemini 3.7 Flash, a coding- and agent-focused model priced at an introductory $0.75/million input and $3.75/million output tokens through year-end -- half of Gemini 3.6 Flash's launch pricing. Google says it outperforms comparable Anthropic and OpenAI models on nine benchmarks, with the largest gains in software engineering and web development. It ships three weeks after 3.6 Flash, and lands in GitHub Copilot and the Gemini app the same day.",
